Scene geometry
--------------
include/xgc2_math/scene/ continues the world_lidar geometry core and the
cluttered_environment obstacle construction of
https://github.com/XGC-Team/xgc2-scene-generation (commit
2940a99abba225e718eed5fb892faac2f5ebaf5c), and the placement, motion and
convex-surface checks of that repository's scene runtime. Those packages declare
the MIT license in their package.xml files; the repository carries no LICENSE
file. Convex hulls use the public-domain quickhull already in
geometry/quickhull.hpp. The OpenGL spherical projection of that repository
(derived from HKUST MARSIM, GPL-2.0) is not part of this component.

